#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: multilingual-store-abilities.php
msgid "Multilingual Store Abilities for WooCommerce"
msgstr "Multilingual Store Abilities für WooCommerce"

#. Description of the plugin
#: multilingual-store-abilities.php
msgid ""
"Read-only abilities (WordPress Abilities API) that let AI agents audit "
"translations, cross-language consistency and multi-currency prices in "
"WooCommerce stores running WPML."
msgstr ""
"Nur lesende Abilities (WordPress Abilities API), mit denen KI-Agenten "
"Übersetzungen, sprachübergreifende Konsistenz und Preise in mehreren "
"Währungen in WooCommerce-Shops mit WPML prüfen."

#. Author of the plugin
#: multilingual-store-abilities.php
msgid "Media Workbench"
msgstr "Media Workbench"

